      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "6A5BB7E1902FAC66",
      "text": "Huh. No kidding.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "6A5BB8E1902FAE19",
      "text": "No need to be shy about it. Friend drama’s just\\npart of life at your age.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "6A5BB5E1902FA900",
      "text": "Here’s the Drayster take: I liked Kieran better\\nwhen his hair was down.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "6A5BB6E1902FAAB3",
      "text": "He used to be this quiet little guy. Trembled like\\na leaf. Had all the spine of a Wimpod.\\c\\nHe’d hide behind Carmine if you so much as\\nbreathed too loud. But I tell you what...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 177,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_08",
      "hash64": "6A5BC3E1902FC0CA",
      "text": "When it came to Pokémon battling, I never saw\\nso much joy in anyone’s eyes as in his![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_09",
      "hash64": "6A5BC4E1902FC27D",
      "text": "But then, outta nowhere, he...changed.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "6A5F41E19032CCBB",
      "text": "Now he’s relentless—pushes himself, pushes\\neveryone around him...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_11",
      "hash64": "6A5F40E19032CB08",
      "text": "Nothing good’s gonna come of this. Someone’s\\ngotta snap him out of it.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "6A5F43E19032D021",
      "text": "I tried but couldn’t do it. Guess I’ve gone soft\\nfrom the lazy life. So now I guess it falls to you.\\r\\nSorry, bud.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_03",
      "hash64": "B94DB3F7E1543BB1",
      "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting! Everything’s ready.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_04",
      "hash64": "B94DB4F7E1543D64",
      "text": "Are you ready to battle Kieran, the BB League\\nChampion?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_05",
      "hash64": "B94DB5F7E1543F17",
      "text": "Please come back when you’re ready.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_06",
      "hash64": "B94DB6F7E15440CA",
      "text": "Understood.\\c\\nYour Championship match will begin soon.\\nPlease make sure you are ready.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
